AI Workspace database migrations

Run commands from the repository root with uv so that Settings can load .env.
The database URL comes from get_settings().database_url; alembic.ini stores no
database credentials. AI_WORKSPACE_DATABASE_URL overrides the value in .env.

Online mode uses an asyncpg-compatible AsyncEngine and Connection.run_sync().
Offline mode generates SQL without a database connection:
    uv run alembic upgrade head --sql
This command only prints SQL; it does not execute it against PostgreSQL.

Inspect the database revision and available script heads:
    uv run alembic current
    uv run alembic heads

versions/ intentionally has no revisions yet. Empty revision output is expected
until real migrations exist. Do not create an empty revision merely for output.
Alembic imports ai_workspace.models to register User on the existing Base.metadata.
No migration revisions have been generated or applied.
